 labhost @LABHOST_VERSION@ - Containerlab Network Swiss Army Knife
============================================================

 Quick start:
   lab-help        Show all helper commands
   lab-status      Show interfaces, routes, VRFs, LAGs,
                   VLANs, NetEm/qdisc state, and ports
   lab-readme      Open the full usage guide

 Persistence:
   lab-save --dry-run   Preview saved startup configuration
   lab-save             Save current supported network state
   lab-config           Display saved startup configuration

